        <mxCell id="s2_5" value="&lt;b&gt;Drain in batches (≤500/tx, loop until empty):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Drain inbox FileManifest rows →&lt;br&gt;read each file-manifest JSON →&lt;br&gt;INSERT expected_file + expected_chunk&lt;br&gt;(ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Also drain FileManifestError rows →&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;INSERT expected_file(Failed) + outbox(files.finalized)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;" parent="s2" vertex="1">
