        <mxCell id="inplace_banner" value="Chunks are NEVER copied to work dir. expected_chunk.name resolves against proxy delivery dir. Assembly reads chunks IN-PLACE during concat, then best-effort deletes consumed chunks post-COMMIT. Reporter sweeps any remainder on terminal job; the proxy self-cleans days-old leftovers." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
